  "completionClaimRule": "Work-package completion, passing tests, green CI, interim snapshots, supervisor approval, and released versions are supporting evidence only. A work package normally terminates as SUBTASK_COMPLETE_PARENT_OPEN. A non-living root mission closes only when the current invariant-purpose epoch/hash is satisfied by backward-traceable evidence, all mandatory packages and release/handback/deletion obligations are complete, no active lease or unreviewed consequential conflict remains, and the terminal comparator returns OWNER_OUTCOME_SATISFIED. A living mission closes only under explicit authorized closure after required final snapshot, subscription, retention, and deletion actions. Participant consent, withdrawal, privacy, licensing, provider, legal, and security authorities remain independently binding throughout."
